  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab Side Steps\nFeatures\nEasy Installation: YITAMOTOR side steps are compatible with 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab New Body Style; Designed for a hassle-free, no-drill installation\nTwo-Stair Layout: Designed with a unique two-stair layout, these running boards provide easy access to your vehicle for all ages; The raised center step offers convenience for placing luggage or items on the roof\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel: Made with high-quality carbon steel, these YITAMOTOR running boards can support up to 550 LBS; They are sturdy, durable, and resistant to deformation\nNon-Slip Design: The hollow design prevents water and sediment accumulation, keeping the running boards dry and clean; This feature enhances safety and durability by reducing the risk of slipping\nWeather Resistant: The surface is covered with a dual-stage textured black powder that can withstand heavy rain and snowstorms; This offers exceptional rust and corrosion resistance\nProfessional installation recommended",
